== Part 1: simulation, 1000 genes, 2 batches x 12 samples (12 per group), 40 repetitions per setting
   k = samples of group A in batch 1 (batch 2 holds 12 - k); k = 6 is balanced

-- null (no group effect): share of genes with p < 0.05 (expected 0.05)
                                      k=6   k=8   k=9  k=10  k=11
ignore batch                        0.018 0.101 0.323 0.506 0.615
batch in the model                  0.050 0.051 0.048 0.050 0.050
ComBat (group protected)            0.063 0.079 0.099 0.156 0.289
ComBat (batch only)                 0.055 0.044 0.027 0.011 0.001
removeBatchEffect (group protected) 0.055 0.071 0.092 0.146 0.280

